  message: "Fixed in PR #2309 (merged to dev, eaa18ee23). Live repro on dev eaa18ee23, outputs in ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/fast_smart_test_build_11172026/pr6/live_repro/ dufuz_lazygit.txt: hypergumbo slice ~/curriculum_repos/lazygit --entry auto -> 'Auto-detected entry: Go main() go:main.go:15-24' (pre-PR dev: pkg/integration/clients/injector/main.go). Measured on 23 repos (pr6/dufuz/RESULTS.md): podman -> cmd/podman/main.go, forgejo -> main.go, caddy -> cmd/caddy/main.go; 19 other picks unchanged. Residuals: WI-nuvav (non-Go), WI-babuv (cobra), WI-lifar, WI-hirim."  # adcc
